.box-container
  .box
    %h1 About GiftBrain
    %p
      GiftBrain is your smart gifting assistant powered by AI.
      Whether you're shopping for a birthday, anniversary, holiday, wedding or "just because" - GiftBrain helps you find the perfect present every time.
  .box
    %h2 How it works
    %p
      Describe who or what you're shopping for - a person, a couple, or a group event.
      Include things like interests, personality, age, or the occasion.
    %p Our AI instantly suggests thoughtful gift ideas, complete with links to marketplaces like Amazon, Etsy, AliExpress, and more.
  .box
    %h2 Group Gifting Made Easy
    %p
      Want to decide as a group? No problem.
      Create a gift party and invite others to vote on the best ideas.
      It's perfect for shared gifts between friends, family, or colleagues.
  .box
    %h2 Our Mission
    %p
      We believe gift-giving should be joyful, not stressful.
      GiftBrain saves you time, removes the guesswork, and helps you discover ideas you wouldn’t have thought of on your own.
  .box
    %h2 Free Forever
    %p
      GiftBrain is completely free to use.
      We earn a small commission through affiliate links when you choose to buy something - at no extra cost to you.
  .box
    %p
      Questions? Suggestions? Want to collaborate? Reach out at
      %a{ href: "mailto:support@giftbrain.app" } support@giftbrain.app
